+/*
+ * GIN GDAKI fault recovery (research build). Active only with NCCL_GIN_FAULT_RECOVERY=1 and
+ * NCCL_GIN_FAULT_CLASSIFY=1 on a GDAKI communicator; otherwise these return ncclInvalidUsage.
+ * Mechanism only: the caller must stop every kernel that posts on the communicator's GIN QPs
+ * before ncclGinRecoverPrepare, run the same sequence on the peer (exchanging the tokens out
+ * of band), and relaunch the failed operation after ncclGinRecoverCommit.
+ */
